 "criterion": {
  "statement": "Delete the capped market-weeks, recompute the share, and compare the move against (i) the same-week deletion band and (ii) the width of the SAME-UNIT re-dating null -- the p05-p95 span of the 12-event mean under re-dating (g30 arms.g19_range.by_key.ratio), which is the object whose percentile the paper reports. Not the pooled single-draw spread. The share's containment transfers to another panel crawled at the same or better coverage iff the move is inside both. The threshold is panel-relative and therefore portable: it is stated as a fraction of the null width, not as a constant.",
